(On behalf of Team Rocket, the student aerospace and robotics division of the AEROX Club at Parul University, Vadodara, under) Tj
T* (the technical supervision of Project Head Darshan Patil, we have the distinct honour of submitting the complete verification) Tj
T* (dossiers, scientific methodology package, and source distribution for LunarSafe—an autonomous, deterministic lunar landing-site) Tj
T* (hazard assessment engine engineered specifically for robotic lunar landers.) Tj
